@startuml
!theme plain
actor "Data Steward" as Steward
participant "Data Governance API" as API
database "Source Register" as Register
queue Worker
participant "OpenAlex / Crossref" as Metadata
collections "Quarantine Object Storage" as Storage

Steward -> API: Register candidate source + intended use
API -> Register: store licence, provenance, restrictions
Steward -> API: approve or reject rights decision
API -> Register: approval evidence
Steward -> API: request acquisition
API -> Register: verify approved use\nand adaptation permission when relevant
API -> Worker: data.acquire_dataset
Worker -> Metadata: approved metadata query
Metadata --> Worker: metadata records
Worker -> Storage: JSONL + SHA-256 manifest
Worker -> Register: counts, checksum, storage prefix
note over API,Storage
Linked full text is not acquired merely
because a DOI or URL was returned.
end note
@enduml
